The scene is classified as an **EvidenceBasedAnomaly** due to the presence of a rolling object (evidence indicator) on the road. The ontology captures the rolling object as a **RoadObject** under **Obstacle**, and the nighttime condition is classified as **NightCondition**. The risks identified are **CollisionRisk** and **OcclusionRisk**, with severity scores reflecting the potential danger of the rolling object and the reduced visibility in nighttime conditions.